        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">This pipeline is also how Spark Ads integrate with other paid formats. A post that performs well as a Spark Ad can be repurposed for <a href="/partnership-ads" class="text-accent hover:underline">Partnership Ads</a> on Meta, <a href="/branded-content-ads" class="text-accent hover:underline">Branded Content Ads</a> on Instagram, or standard <a href="/ugc-ads" class="text-accent hover:underline">UGC ad campaigns</a> across platforms. The organic-to-paid pipeline on TikTok is the starting point for a multi-platform paid content strategy. For a deeper look at how <a href="/guide" class="text-accent hover:underline">creative testing</a> works across the full funnel, see our main guide.</p>
